Kissne Laya integration attribution

The Android tokenizer, prompt builder, decoder, calibration loader and LiteRT engine are adapted from the Laya multilingual LiteRT Android sample by John Rocky, licensed under Apache License 2.0. The sample ports host-side components from Laya 0.3.4 by Convai Innovations.

Source: https://github.com/john-rocky/LiteRT-Models/tree/main/laya
Original model project: https://huggingface.co/convaiinnovations/laya
Converted multilingual model: https://huggingface.co/litert-community/Laya-Multilingual-LiteRT

The model assets are downloaded on demand to the device. Expected SHA-256 hashes are pinned in LayaLocal.kt.
